            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "……先日、\n珍しいものが飛んでいるのを見てな。",
            "enText": "…I saw a rare sight yesterday.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 8576194591223712633,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "アレは確かに鷹だった……。\r\nまさかトレセン学園の校内で見られるとは。",
            "enText": "Pretty sure it was a hawk… Never thought \nI'd see such a big bird on campus.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -7056863366603257994,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "野生の猛禽類にとって、都会が\n住みやすい環境になってきているとも言うが。",
            "enText": "Maybe birds of prey find the city \nmore hospitable nowadays.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 771587044480718831,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "大空を舞う勇姿、また見てみたいものだ。",
            "enText": "Either way, I'd like to see that gallant \nsilhouette again sometime.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -1329559057416407413,
            "blockIdx": 4
        }
